## Title: DLC Roulette
## Author: -Chin
## Description: Random DLC dungeon queue in one press, Veteran or Normal. It skips the dungeons you have just run. Pick your dungeons; new DLC dungeons are added automatically. Dungeon finder, LFG, PS5, Xbox, PC.
## Version: 1.1.3
## AddOnVersion: 5
## APIVersion: 101051
## SavedVariables: DLCRoulette_SavedVariables
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings

